Subject: Share original frontend named slide selection reset predicates

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Share the original presentation/component clock reset conditions with retained
native scene playback. Preserve missing-selection clearing, first hash lookup
and the component-only Update(0) in their respective callers. No handler or
scene-manager readiness behavior is selected.

Refreshed for decomp 9046e67a: fePresentation.cpp and tlComponent.cpp keep
their upstream text (the series' later restore patches made these edits net
zero).

diff --git a/include/Game/FE/FrontendSelectionSteps.h b/include/Game/FE/FrontendSelectionSteps.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..de0e5f2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/Game/FE/FrontendSelectionSteps.h
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+#ifndef GAME_FE_FRONTEND_SELECTION_STEPS_H
+#define GAME_FE_FRONTEND_SELECTION_STEPS_H
+// Original FEPresentation/TLComponent reset predicates. Selection identity and
+// lookup stay with each caller; component Update(0) follows selection.
+inline void FrontendSelectPresentationTime(float& time, bool resetTime, bool changed)
+{
+    if (resetTime || changed)
+    {
+        time = 0.0f;
+    }
+}
+inline void FrontendSelectComponentTime(float& time, bool forceReset, bool changed, bool preserveTime)
+{
+    if (forceReset || changed)
+    {
+        if (!preserveTime)
+        {
+            time = 0.0f;
+        }
+    }
+}
+#endif
